msgid "# OSSの評価方法"
msgstr "# Evaluating Open Source Software"

#. type: 註解
#: operation-templates/using/evaluation.md:2
#: operation-templates/using/finding-oss.md:2
#: operation-templates/using/oss-inventory.md:2
#: operation-templates/using/supplier-procurement.md:2
